Package: openmediavault-intelgpustats
Architecture: all
Depends:
 openmediavault (>= 7),
 ${misc:Depends}
Recommends:
 intel-gpu-tools
Description: Intel GPU statistics dashboard plugin for OpenMediaVault
 Adds dashboard widgets to OpenMediaVault that display real-time Intel
 integrated GPU (iGPU) metrics: temperature, render utilisation, GT
 frequency, and power draw.
 .
 Metrics are read from the i915 sysfs interface (always available) and,
 when the intel-gpu-tools package is installed, from intel_gpu_top for
 richer utilisation and power data.
